<title>UK: Millwall FC in Norwegian weather forecast ad pact.</title>
<headline>Millwall FC in Norwegian weather forecast ad pact.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Players at English soccer club Millwall will take the pitch next season proudly bearing the logo &quot;The Weather in Norwegian&quot; following a sponsorship deal with Britain's LIVE TV cable channel.</p>
<p>Millwall Holdings Plc on Monday announced it had struck a two-year sponsorship contract with LIVE TV, whose programmes include weather forecasts in Norwegian and topless darts competitions.</p>
<p>&quot;I believe in marketing innovation,&quot; Theo Papitis, chairman elect of the second division club said in a statement.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
